        {
          "id": 401001079,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Just sifted through the CI logs (`vimdiff`ed with the logs of a passing job) and it seems the problem is with `tools/validate-clang-check.py` (which, to my surprise, is a bash script).\nIt cannot find the `clang-check` binary, which doesn't seem related to my changes, but definitely requires a fix.\n\nThe related lines are:\n```\n$ sh -c '[ ! -e ../tools/validate-clang-check.py ] || ../tools/validate-clang-check.py'\n../tools/validate-clang-check.py: 17: ../tools/validate-clang-check.py: clang-check: not found\n../tools/validate-clang-check.py: 18: ../tools/validate-clang-check.py: clang-check: not found\n```",
